{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17207730","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17207730","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1720773001:1":{"text":"诸位，我是耀光帝国的佩吉公主。今日，我以王室代表的身份来到这里，向一位被遗忘的英雄致敬。","source_cn":"诸位，我是耀光帝国的佩吉公主。今日，我以王室代表的身份...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97FB3ADD9580F760","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1720773002:1":{"text":"在这里长眠的，是年轻的朱利诺。","source_cn":"在这里长眠的，是年轻的朱利诺。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB667DA941940F085","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1720773003:1":{"text":"他没有显赫的爵位，也没有为人传颂的功勋，但他用自己年轻的生命和一腔热血，在二十年前的神魔大战时守护了我们脚下的土地……","source_cn":"他没有显赫的爵位，也没有为人传颂的功勋，但他用自己年轻...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C849D5C61CBDC1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1720773004:1":{"text":"……他带走了战火和伤痛，留下了赛凡纳的和平和心碎的母亲。","source_cn":"……他带走了战火和伤痛，留下了赛凡纳的和平和心碎的母亲。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x604400BDFC0FC44D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1720773005:1":{"text":"我们如今拥有的繁华与安宁，并不是凭空而来的。它是用无数个像朱利诺这样的名字，用无数位母亲的眼泪换来的。","source_cn":"我们如今拥有的繁华与安宁，并不是凭空而来的。它是用无数...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE802D657DF9F89B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1720773006:1":{"text":"他们或许没有名字留在史书上，但他们才是耀光真正的基石。遗忘他们，就是背叛了我们的过去。","source_cn":"他们或许没有名字留在史书上，但他们才是耀光真正的基石。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2D32F3820307B5A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1720773007:1":{"text":"所以，我今天来到这里，不为别的，只为了告诉这位母亲，也告诉所有人：帝国没有忘记。我们，永远不会忘记。","source_cn":"所以，我今天来到这里，不为别的，只为了告诉这位母亲，也...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3C38650560FBE7D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1720773008:1":{"text":"人群中一片寂静，许多人都低下了头，也有人在悄悄抹眼泪。佩吉这番话没有华丽的辞藻，却比任何演讲都更打动人心。","source_cn":"人群中一片寂静，许多人都低下了头，也有人在悄悄抹眼泪。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1549578689858B03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1720773009:0":{"text":"老妇人颤抖着抬起头，浑浊的眼中满是泪水与感激。","source_cn":"老妇人颤抖着抬起头，浑浊的眼中满是泪水与感激。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA719E59EBC4CCA6F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1720773010:0":{"text":"殿下……朱利诺他……他在天上看着，一定也会很高兴的……","source_cn":"殿下……朱利诺他……他在天上看着，一定也会很高兴的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x217AC4223178A492","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1720773011:1":{"text":"夫人，今晚是我的生日宴会。虽然有些冒昧，但我还是想请您……作为我重要的长辈出席。","source_cn":"夫人，今晚是我的生日宴会。虽然有些冒昧，但我还是想请您...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB58D7C986E06818","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1720773012:1":{"text":"我想让所有人都知道，能有您这样一位伟大的母亲，是耀光的荣幸。","source_cn":"我想让所有人都知道，能有您这样一位伟大的母亲，是耀光的荣幸。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B61002339A342EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1720773013:1":{"text":"公主殿下，谢谢……谢谢您，我会去的。","source_cn":"公主殿下，谢谢……谢谢您，我会去的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9CEF8F8FF3267D46","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:佩吉":{"text":"佩吉","source":"佩吉","status":"source"},"speaker:旁白":{"text":"旁白","source":"旁白","status":"source"},"speaker:玛拉":{"text":"玛拉","source":"玛拉","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":14,"localized_text_count":13,"speaker_count":3}}